---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Privacy Policy – Naivaidya Healthcare">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="prose max-w-none">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-6">Privacy Policy - Naivaidya HealthCare</h1>
      
      <p class="mb-4">
        At <b>Naivaidya Healthcare</b>, we strongly believe in protecting our customers' privacy. When we collect personal information from you, we will use our best endeavors to use it or disclose it only in the manner described below. By using our website and services, you agree to the practices outlined in this policy.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Communication with You</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Each time you use our services, we may send you an email verifying instructions and confirming that the activities envisaged under your request have been received. We also reserve the right to send all customers occasional email communications regarding:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-4 pl-5">
        <li>Updates and changes to our services</li>
        <li>New links or features on our website</li>
        <li>Technical, administrative, or legal notices important to our website, products, and services</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Please note that customers are not able to unsubscribe from these essential notifications.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Information Shared</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We are the sole owners of the information collected on this website. We will not sell, rent, or otherwise disclose your personal information to any third party without your consent, except in the following circumstances:
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3">1. Aggregate Non-Personal Information:</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We may share non-personal, non-identifiable information in aggregate form with third parties for business purposes. This does not involve disclosing any personal information that could identify an individual customer.
      </p>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3">2. Legal or Investigative Disclosure:</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We may disclose your personal information to any appropriate investigative third party if we believe you are involved in illegal or harmful conduct, or if required by law. Such disclosure may occur to:
      </p>
      <ul class="list-disc list-inside mb-4 pl-5">
        <li>Comply with legal obligations or legal process</li>
        <li>Protect and defend the rights and property of <b>Naivaidya Healthcare</b> or our customers</li>
        <li>Prevent fraud</li>
        <li>Protect against abuse, misuse, or unauthorized use of our website</li>
        <li>Ensure the personal safety of our customers or the public</li>
      </ul>
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mt-6 mb-3">3. Service Providers:</h3>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We may employ third-party companies to provide services on our behalf, such as processing credit card payments. These companies have limited access to personal information strictly for performing their functions and are bound by confidentiality agreements to prevent any unauthorized use.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Links to Other Websites</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Our website may contain links to other websites. Please note that <b>Naivaidya Healthcare</b> is <b>not responsible</b> for the privacy practices of these external websites. We advise you to read the privacy statements of each website you visit which collects personal information.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">
        A cookie is an alphanumeric identifier transferred to your device through your web browser when you visit our website. Cookies help our system recognize you on return visits and improve our service to you.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        Cookies may also be used to compile aggregate information about which areas of our website are visited most frequently. This traffic information helps us enhance the content of our website and make your experience easier.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        We <b>do not</b> track individual page views or personal activity while you browse the site.
      </p>
      <p class="mb-4">
        If you wish to reject cookies, you can configure your browser to do so, but some features of our website may not function properly.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
